#. module: tk_loan_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_loan_management.loan_request_submitted_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.contact_name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Thank you for choosing\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id\" t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"not object.company_id\" t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].name\"/>. We are writing to confirm that we have\n"
"                    successfully received your loan application for \"<t t-out=\"object.approved_loan_type_id.name\"/>\"\n"
"                    submitted on <span t-if=\"ctx['date_time']\" t-out=\"ctx['date_time']\"/>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Our team will begin processing your request, and we will reach out to you soon with any updates or\n"
"                    if additional information is needed.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    We appreciate your trust in us and look forward to assisting you. If you have any questions, please\n"
"                    don’t hesitate to contact us\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    In the meantime, you can track the status of your loan by clicking on the \"Track Loan Request\"\n"
"                    button\n"
"                    below:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <a t-att-href=\"object.customer_requested_loan_tracking_url\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 1px solid #28a745;                                                     padding: 4px 24px;                                                     text-decoration: none;                                                     color: white;                                                     background-color: #28a745;                                                     border-radius: 3px;                                                     font-size: 0.875rem;                                                     font-weight: 500;\">\n"
"                    Track Loan Request\n"
"                </a>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    We appreciate your trust in us and look forward to assisting you. If you have any questions, please\n"
"                    don’t hesitate to contact us.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Phone :\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\" t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Email :\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\" t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Website :\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\" t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"not object.company_id\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].name\"/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Phone :\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"ctx['lead_company'].phone\" t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].phone\"/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Email :\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"ctx['lead_company'].email\" t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].email\"/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Website :\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"ctx['lead_company'].website\" t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<p>скъпи\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.contact_name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Thank you for choosing\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id\" t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"not object.company_id\" t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].name\"/>Пишем Ви, за да потвърдим, че имаме\n"
"                     успешно получих вашата заявка за заем \"<t t-out=\"object.approved_loan_type_id.name\"/>\"\n"
"                    подадено на <span t-if=\"ctx['date_time']\" t-out=\"ctx['date_time']\"/>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Нашият екип ще започне да обработва заявката ви и скоро ще се свържем с вас с всякакви актуализации или\n"
"                    ако е необходима допълнителна информация.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Оценяваме доверието Ви и очакваме с нетърпение да Ви помогнем. Ако имате някакви въпроси, моля,\n"
"                    не се колебайте да се свържете с нас\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Междувременно можете да следите състоянието на вашия заем, като кликнете върху \"Проследяване на искане за заем\"\n"
"                    бутон\n"
"                    по-долу:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <a t-att-href=\"object.customer_requested_loan_tracking_url\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 1px solid #28a745;                                                     padding: 4px 24px;                                                     text-decoration: none;                                                     color: white;                                                     background-color: #28a745;                                                     border-radius: 3px;                                                     font-size: 0.875rem;                                                     font-weight: 500;\">\n"
"                    Проследяване на искане за заем\n"
"                </a>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Оценяваме доверието Ви и очакваме с нетърпение да Ви помогнем. Ако имате някакви въпроси, моля,\n"
"                    не се колебайте да се свържете с нас.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\" t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            имейл адрес:\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\" t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\" t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"not object.company_id\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].name\"/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"ctx['lead_company'].phone\" t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].phone\"/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Имейл:\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"ctx['lead_company'].email\" t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].email\"/>\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"ctx['lead_company'].website\" t-out=\"ctx['lead_company'].website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

#. module: tk_loan_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_loan_management.loan_request_approved_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    We are pleased to inform you that your loan request has been successfully approved. Your loan\n"
"                    reference number is <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to reach out to us.\n"
"                    We're happy to help.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Thank you for choosing <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>. We look forward to continuing to serve\n"
"                    you.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        Phone :\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\" t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        Email :\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\" t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        Website :\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\" t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<p>скъпи\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Радваме се да Ви информираме, че заявката Ви за заем е успешно одобрена. Вашият заем\n"
"                    референтният номер е <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Ако имате някакви въпроси или се нуждаете от допълнителна помощ, моля не се колебайте да се свържете с нас.\n"
"                    Радваме се да помогнем.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Благодарим ви, че избрахте <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>Очакваме с нетърпение да продължим да Ви обслужваме.\n"
"                    вие.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        Телефон:\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\" t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        Имейл:\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\" t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                    <span>\n"
"                        уебсайт:\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\" t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

#. module: tk_loan_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_loan_management.customer_signed_loan_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>I hope this message finds you well.</p>\n"
"                <p>I am pleased to inform you that your loan sanction letter has been successfully signed. Please find the following documents attached for your reference:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Signature Certificate :</strong>\n"
"                        This document confirms your signed agreement.\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Loan Sanction Letter :</strong>\n"
"                        A detailed breakdown of the loan.\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>If you have any questions or need further clarification regarding the documents, please do not hesitate to reach out.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Phone :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Email :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Website :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<p>скъпи\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Надявам се, че това съобщение те завари добре.</p>\n"
"                <p>Имам удоволствието да Ви информирам, че писмото Ви за одобрение на заем е успешно подписано. Моля, прикачете следните документи за справка:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Удостоверение за подпис:</strong>\n"
"                        Този документ потвърждава подписаното от вас споразумение.\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Писмо за санкциониране на заем:</strong>\n"
"                        Подробно разпределение на заема.\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>Ако имате въпроси или се нуждаете от допълнителни разяснения относно документите, не се колебайте да се свържете с нас.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Имейл:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

#. module: tk_loan_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_loan_management.collateral_request_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>I hope this message finds you well.</p>\n"
"                <p>I am reaching out to kindly remind you to upload the required collateral document for\n"
"                    processing your '<t t-out=\"object.approved_loan_type_id.name\"/>' application,loan reference no.\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Please upload the following types of collateral at your earliest convenience:</strong>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"object.collateral_ids\" t-as=\"collateral\">\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"collateral.is_requested_from_customer and not collateral.document\">\n"
"                            <li>\n"
"                                <strong t-field=\"collateral.collateral_type_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            </li>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    You can upload the collateral documents by logging into your account through the link provided\n"
"                    below:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <a t-att-href=\"object.customer_requested_document_portal_url\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 1px solid #28a745;                                                     padding: 4px 24px;                                                     text-decoration: none;                                                     color: white;                                                     background-color: #28a745;                                                     border-radius: 3px;                                                     font-size: 0.875rem;                                                     font-weight: 500;\">\n"
"                    login\n"
"                </a>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    If you need any assistance or have any questions, feel free to reach out, and I'll be happy to help.\n"
"                    We look forward to receiving the documents soon.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Phone :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Email :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Website :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<p>скъпи\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Надявам се, че това съобщение те завари добре.</p>\n"
"                <p>Свързвам се с Вас, за да Ви напомня да качите необходимия документ за обезпечение за\n"
"                    обработка на вашите'<t t-out=\"object.approved_loan_type_id.name\"/>' заявление, референтен номер на заем\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Моля, качете следните видове обезпечения възможно най-скоро:</strong>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"object.collateral_ids\" t-as=\"collateral\">\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"collateral.is_requested_from_customer and not collateral.document\">\n"
"                            <li>\n"
"                                <strong t-field=\"collateral.collateral_type_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            </li>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Можете да качите документите за обезпечение, като влезете в профила си чрез предоставената връзка\n"
"                    по-долу:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <a t-att-href=\"object.customer_requested_document_portal_url\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 1px solid #28a745;                                                     padding: 4px 24px;                                                     text-decoration: none;                                                     color: white;                                                     background-color: #28a745;                                                     border-radius: 3px;                                                     font-size: 0.875rem;                                                     font-weight: 500;\">\n"
"                    вход\n"
"                </a>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Ако имате нужда от помощ или въпроси, не се колебайте да се свържете с мен и ще се радвам да ви помогна.\n"
"                    Очакваме с нетърпение да получим документите скоро.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Имейл:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

#. module: tk_loan_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_loan_management.document_request_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>I hope this message finds you well.</p>\n"
"                <p>I am reaching out to kindly remind you to upload the required documents for\n"
"                    processing your '<t t-out=\"object.approved_loan_type_id.name\"/>' application,loan reference no.\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Please upload the following types of document at your earliest convenience:</strong>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"object.customer_loan_doc_ids\" t-as=\"document\">\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"document.is_requested_from_customer and not document.document\">\n"
"                            <li>\n"
"                                <strong t-field=\"document.document_type_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            </li>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    You can upload the documents by logging into your account through the link provided below:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <a t-att-href=\"object.customer_requested_document_portal_url\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 1px solid #28a745;                                                     padding: 4px 24px;                                                     text-decoration: none;                                                     color: white;                                                     background-color: #28a745;                                                     border-radius: 3px;                                                     font-size: 0.875rem;                                                     font-weight: 500;\">\n"
"                    login\n"
"                </a>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    If you need any assistance or have any questions, feel free to reach out, and I'll be happy to help.\n"
"                    We look forward to receiving the documents soon.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Phone :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Email :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Website :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<p>скъпи\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Надявам се, че това съобщение те завари добре.</p>\n"
"                <p>Свързвам се с Вас, за да Ви напомня да качите необходимите документи за\n"
"                    обработка на вашите '<t t-out=\"object.approved_loan_type_id.name\"/>' заявление, референтен номер на заем\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Моля, качете следните видове документи възможно най-скоро:</strong>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"object.customer_loan_doc_ids\" t-as=\"document\">\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"document.is_requested_from_customer and not document.document\">\n"
"                            <li>\n"
"                                <strong t-field=\"document.document_type_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            </li>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Можете да качите документите, като влезете в профила си чрез връзката, предоставена по-долу:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <a t-att-href=\"object.customer_requested_document_portal_url\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 1px solid #28a745;                                                     padding: 4px 24px;                                                     text-decoration: none;                                                     color: white;                                                     background-color: #28a745;                                                     border-radius: 3px;                                                     font-size: 0.875rem;                                                     font-weight: 500;\">\n"
"                    вход\n"
"                </a>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Ако имате нужда от помощ или въпроси, не се колебайте да се свържете с мен и ще се радвам да ви помогна.\n"
"                    Очакваме с нетърпение да получим документите скоро.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            имейл адрес:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

#. module: tk_loan_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_loan_management.installment_reminder_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>I hope this message finds you well.</p>\n"
"                <p>This is a reminder that your installment payment of\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.current_installment_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                    for loan reference no.\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>\n"
"                    is due on\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.current_installment_due_date\"/>\n"
"                    . We kindly ask that you make the payment by this date to avoid any late fees or\n"
"                    disruptions to your service.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Please find the payment details below:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Amount Due:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.current_installment_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Due Date:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.current_installment_due_date\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>If you have already made the payment, please disregard this notice. Should you have any questions or\n"
"                    require assistance, feel free to reach out to us.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Phone :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Email :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Website :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<p>скъпи\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Надявам се, че това съобщение те завари добре.</p>\n"
"                <p>Това е напомняне, че плащането ви на вноски от\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.current_installment_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                    за референтен номер на заем\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>\n"
"                    се дължи на\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.current_installment_due_date\"/>\n"
"                    Учтиво Ви молим да извършите плащането до тази дата, за да избегнете евентуални такси за закъснение или\n"
"                    прекъсвания на вашата услуга.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Моля, вижте данните за плащане по-долу:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Дължима сума:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.current_installment_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Краен срок:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.current_installment_due_date\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>Ако вече сте извършили плащането, моля, не вземайте предвид това известие. Ако имате някакви въпроси или\n"
"                    имате нужда от помощ, не се колебайте да се свържете с нас.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            имейл адрес:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

#. module: tk_loan_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_loan_management.sanction_letter_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>I hope this message finds you well.</p>\n"
"                <p>We are pleased to inform you that your loan application\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>\n"
"                    with <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>. has been approved. Congratulations!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Loan Details:</strong>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Loan Type:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.approved_loan_type_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Loan Amount Approved:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.loan_amount\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Interest Rate:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.interest_rate\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Loan Tenure:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.term\"/>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'monthly'\">\n"
"                            Months\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'quarterly'\">\n"
"                            Quarters\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'yearly'\">\n"
"                            Years\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Our team will now begin preparing the necessary documentation and processing the\n"
"                    disbursement. If you have any questions regarding the terms or next steps,\n"
"                    please don’t hesitate to reach out.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Thank you for choosing<t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>. We look forward to\n"
"                    serving you.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Phone :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Email :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Website :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<p>скъпи\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Надявам се, че това съобщение те завари добре.</p>\n"
"                <p>Имаме удоволствието да Ви информираме, че заявлението Ви за заем\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>\n"
"                    with <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>. беше одобрен. Поздравления!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Подробности за заема:</strong>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Тип заем:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.approved_loan_type_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Одобрена сума на заема:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.loan_amount\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Лихвен процент:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.interest_rate\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Срок на заема:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.term\"/>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'monthly'\">\n"
"                            месеци\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'quarterly'\">\n"
"                            Четвъртини\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'yearly'\">\n"
"                            години\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>За да продължим с изплащането, любезно Ви молим да потвърдите. Моля, прегледайте\n"
"                    подробности за заема, уведомете ни, ако имате някакви въпроси.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <strong>Следващи стъпки:</strong>\n"
"                <p>1. Изпратете потвърждението си по имейл.</p>\n"
"                <p>2. Кликнете върху бутона за потвърждение по-долу, за да приемете писмото за санкциониране:\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <a t-att-href=\"object.customer_loan_portal_url\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 1px solid #28a745;                                                     padding: 4px 24px;                                                     text-decoration: none;                                                     color: white;                                                     background-color: #28a745;                                                     border-radius: 3px;                                                     font-size: 0.875rem;                                                     font-weight: 500;\">\n"
"                    Потвърдете\n"
"                </a>\n"
"                <p>Препоръчваме Ви да потвърдите възможно най-скоро, за да можем да започнем плащането.\n"
"                    обработете незабавно.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Благодарим ви, че избрахте <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>Очакваме с нетърпение да Ви обслужим.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Имейл:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            "

