"                <p>Моля, имайте предвид, че е важно да изплатите непогасените плащания възможно най-скоро, за да избегнете\n"
"                   допълнителни санкции или други действия съгласно договора за заем.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Разбираме, че непредвидени обстоятелства може да са причинили забавянето и ако имате нужда от\n"
"                    съдействие или желаете да обсъдите опциите за плащане, моля, не се колебайте да се свържете с нас.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Оценяваме незабавното Ви внимание към този въпрос. Моля, извършете плащането възможно най-скоро.\n"
"                    удобство, за да се избегнат допълнителни проблеми.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Благодаря ви за съдействието.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            имейл адрес:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>"

#. module: tk_loan_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_loan_management.loan_disbursement_confirmation_mail_template
msgid ""
"<style>\n"
"                    .text-right {\n"
"                    text-align: right;\n"
"                    }\n"
"                    .text-center {\n"
"                    text-align: left;\n"
"                    }\n"
"                    tr:nth-child(even) {background-color: #f2f2f2;}\n"
"                    .center {\n"
"                    margin-left: 3rem;\n"
"                    margin-right: 3rem;\n"
"                    padding-left: 3rem;\n"
"                    padding-right:3rem;\n"
"                    }\n"
"                </style>\n"
"                <body><p>Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>I hope this message finds you well.</p>\n"
"                <p>We are pleased to confirm that your loan of\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.loan_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                    has been successfully disbursed to your\n"
"                    account on <t t-out=\"object.disbursement_date\"/>. Below is the detailed breakdown of your loan\n"
"                    installments and\n"
"                    repayment schedule:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Loan Details:</strong>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Loan Amount:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.loan_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Interest Rate:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.interest_rate\"/>\n"
"                        <span>%</span>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Loan Term:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.term\"/>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'monthly'\">\n"
"                            Months\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'quarterly'\">\n"
"                            Quarters\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'yearly'\">\n"
"                            Years\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Disbursement Date:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.disbursement_date\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Loan Reference Number:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li t-if=\"object.bill_id.state == 'posted'\">\n"
"                        <strong>Loan Disbursement Reference Number:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.bill_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <table t-if=\"object.loan_lines_ids\" style=\"border:1px solid; border-collapse: collapse; width:90%;\">\n"
"                    <tr style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;background-color: #86cffc;\">\n"
"                        <th colspan=\"5\" style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem; text-align:center;\">Installment\n"
"                            Breakdown\n"
"                        </th>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;background-color: #a9ddfc;\">\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Installment No.</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Installment Date.</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Installment Amount without\n"
"                            Interest\n"
"                        </th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Interest</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Total Installment Amount</th>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"0\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"object.loan_lines_ids\" t-as=\"ld\">\n"
"                        <tr t-attf-style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;{{'background-color: #f2f2f2;' if count % 2 != 0 else 'background-color: #FFFFFF;'}}\">\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.installments_no\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.emi_date\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.installment_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.interest_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.total_installment_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                        </tr>\n"
"                        <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"count + 1\"/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <tr t-attf-style=\"{{'background-color: #f2f2f2;' if count % 2 != 0 else 'background-color: #FFFFFF;'}}\">\n"
"                        <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\" colspan=\"2\">\n"
"                            <strong>Total</strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                            <strong t-field=\"object.loan_amount\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                            <strong t-field=\"object.interest_amount\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                            <strong t-field=\"object.total_amount\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                </table>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Important Notes:</p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        Your first installment is due on\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.installment_start_date\"/>.\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        Please ensure that your payments are made on or before the due date to avoid any penalties.\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    If you have any questions or require further assistance regarding your loan or payment schedule,\n"
"                    please feel free to reach out to us.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Phone :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Email :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Website :\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>"
msgstr ""
"<style>\n"
"                    .text-right {\n"
"                    text-align: right;\n"
"                    }\n"
"                    .text-center {\n"
"                    text-align: left;\n"
"                    }\n"
"                    tr:nth-child(even) {background-color: #f2f2f2;}\n"
"                    .center {\n"
"                    margin-left: 3rem;\n"
"                    margin-right: 3rem;\n"
"                    padding-left: 3rem;\n"
"                    padding-right:3rem;\n"
"                    }\n"
"                </style>\n"
"                <body><p>скъпи\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>Надявам се, че това съобщение те завари добре.</p>\n"
"                <p>Радваме се да потвърдим, че вашият заем от\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.loan_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                    е успешно изплатено на вашия\n"
"                    сметка на <t t-out=\"object.disbursement_date\"/>. По-долу е дадена подробна разбивка на вашия заем\n"
"                    вноски и\n"
"                    погасителен план:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Подробности за заема:</strong>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Сума на кредита:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.loan_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Лихвен процент:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.interest_rate\"/>\n"
"                        <span>%</span>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Срок на заема:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.term\"/>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'monthly'\">\n"
"                            месеци\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'quarterly'\">\n"
"                            Четвъртини\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.installment_type == 'yearly'\">\n"
"                            години\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Дата на плащане:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.disbursement_date\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Референтен номер на заема:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li t-if=\"object.bill_id.state == 'posted'\">\n"
"                        <strong>Референтен номер за отпускане на заем:</strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.bill_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <table t-if=\"object.loan_lines_ids\" style=\"border:1px solid; border-collapse: collapse; width:90%;\">\n"
"                    <tr style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;background-color: #86cffc;\">\n"
"                        <th colspan=\"5\" style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem; text-align:center;\">Вноска\n"
"                            Разбивка\n"
"                        </th>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;background-color: #a9ddfc;\">\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Вноска №</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Дата на плащане.</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Размер на вноска без\n"
"                            интерес\n"
"                        </th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">интерес</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">Обща сума на вноската</th>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"0\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"object.loan_lines_ids\" t-as=\"ld\">\n"
"                        <tr t-attf-style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;{{'background-color: #f2f2f2;' if count % 2 != 0 else 'background-color: #FFFFFF;'}}\">\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.installments_no\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.emi_date\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.installment_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.interest_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                            <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                                <t t-esc=\"ld.total_installment_amount\" t-options=\"{&quot;widget&quot;: &quot;monetary&quot;, &quot;display_currency&quot;: object.company_id.currency_id}\"/>\n"
"                            </td>\n"
"                        </tr>\n"
"                        <t t-set=\"count\" t-value=\"count + 1\"/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <tr t-attf-style=\"{{'background-color: #f2f2f2;' if count % 2 != 0 else 'background-color: #FFFFFF;'}}\">\n"
"                        <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\" colspan=\"2\">\n"
"                            <strong>Общо</strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                            <strong t-field=\"object.loan_amount\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                            <strong t-field=\"object.interest_amount\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"border:1px solid; padding:0.625rem;text-align:right;\">\n"
"                            <strong t-field=\"object.total_amount\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                </table>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Важни бележки:</p>\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        Първата ви вноска е дължима на\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.installment_start_date\"/>.\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        Моля, уверете се, че плащанията ви са извършени на или преди датата на падежа, за да избегнете евентуални неустойки.\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Ако имате въпроси или се нуждаете от допълнителна помощ относно вашия заем или график за плащане,\n"
"                    не се колебайте да се свържете с нас.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <p>най-добри пожелания,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Телефон:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            Имейл:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"object.company_id.website\">\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            уебсайт:\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                        </span>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>"

